From dc648d086394d645a857582bf4fcf07384d49784 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dominggoes Isakh <drjisakh@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 23:13:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 11/11] power-libperfmgr: statically link libperfmgr instead of
 dynamic linking

Root cause trail (see device/samsung/gts2-common commits for the
logcat evidence): system_server was being watchdog-killed 67s into
boot, blocked in PowerManagerService.nativeInit(), because
android.hardware.power.IPower/default never registers - the service
binary fails to even start:

  F linker: CANNOT LINK EXECUTABLE
    ".../android.hardware.power-service.lineage-libperfmgr":
    library "libperfmgr.so" not found

libperfmgr.so itself builds and links fine (confirmed via readelf on
the installed binary and the ninja dependency graph), but Soong never
registers a standalone Make-bridged module for this particular
vendor_available cc_library on this product - it only appears inline
inside consumers' LOCAL_SHARED_LIBRARIES lists in the generated
Android-lineage_gts210wifi.mk. That means there is no way to make
PRODUCT_PACKAGES install it: both "libperfmgr" and "libperfmgr.vendor"
fail Make's PRODUCT_PACKAGES existence check with "includes
non-existent modules in PRODUCT_PACKAGES", since there's no CLEAR_VARS
block for either name to resolve against.

Sidestep the whole problem: this device already statically links two
of this exact binary's other dependencies this same way
(libaconfig_storage_read_api_cc, powerhal_flags-aconfig-cc) and
whole-static-links libperfmgr-ext by default, so there's clear
precedent for treating this internal-implementation library as a
build-time-only dependency rather than an installed runtime artifact.
Moving libperfmgr from shared_libs to static_libs removes the runtime
.so dependency entirely - nothing needs to be installed for the binary
to link and run.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I3a15b44f57597c9a8617b5757768e54b618a3f0c
---
 power-libperfmgr/Android.bp | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/power-libperfmgr/Android.bp b/power-libperfmgr/Android.bp
index af0b373..b98d645 100644
--- a/power-libperfmgr/Android.bp
+++ b/power-libperfmgr/Android.bp
@@ -31,7 +31,6 @@ cc_binary {
         "libcutils",
         "libdl",
         "liblog",
-        "libperfmgr",
         "libprocessgroup",
         "libutils",
         "pixel-power-ext-V1-ndk",
@@ -42,6 +41,7 @@ cc_binary {
         "libaconfig_storage_read_api_cc",
         "libgmock",
         "libgtest",
+        "libperfmgr",
         "powerhal_flags-aconfig-cc",
     ],
     whole_static_libs: select(soong_config_variable("power_libperfmgr", "mode_extension_lib"), {
